\title{Range-based volatility indicators an instrument calculates from its candles}
\description{
Measures of how far prices range. Each method fetches the instrument's candles through \code{prices()}, adds one TA-Lib column, computed by the \code{talib} package, and returns the candles. The class is a link in the chain of analysis classes, inheriting \code{PriceTransforms}, and \code{Instrument} inherits it through that chain and supplies \code{prices()}.
}
